title: "Decision Evidence Signals v1: Synthetic Advisory Dataset for Insurance and Justice Domains"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-01-06
url: "https://huggingface.co/datasets/BDR-AI/decision_evidence_signals_v1"
